875 0 obj
  << /ActualText (It is entirely mechanical and fail\055safe\056 It requires zero electrical power\054 batteries\054 or software\056 In an emergency blackout or ambulance crash\054 as long as there is gas pressure\054 the tube accurately displays flow\056)
